description: >
  Brevity-sweep audit of `src/tools/info/.aide` — description ~249 chars (just over cap), intent ~249 words (2.5x cap), 13 desired outcomes; body Strategy enumerates the `outdated` field plus brain-state union member-by-member.
intent: >
  aide_info is the boot-time precondition reporter. Spec is bloated because
  it documents both the staleness-detection contract and the brain-state
  forward, with 13 desired outcomes each restating one slice of the response
  shape. Most outcomes are unit-testable invariants.
misalignment:
  - spec-bloat
